Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go until you're in full control of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the psychologist and resume your therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and look up the psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot left you have no idea about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and set fire to the consulting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to make any decisions at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave now and decide later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll probably love you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she the best thing that ever happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Therapy may be quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it's time to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for action.
